window.products.push({"id":108018,"name":"Dishwasher High Limit Thermostat Replacement 661566,For Whirlpool Kenmore Maytag Dishwashers - Replaces WP661566 W10339474 AP6010246 PS11743423 AP6010","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.76,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41GVV0lYomL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product description A high limit thermostat is a safety device located at the bottom of your dishwasher. It prevents the dishwasher from overheating by shutting down the power to the heating element if the temperature rises above a certain point. When the thermostat fails, your dishwasher won’t produce the heat that it needs to wash and dry your dishes.  Installation Tips. Unplug your dishwasher before beginning the repair. You’ll just need a quarter-inch nut driver and a small flathead screwdriver. Before removing the wires from the old thermostat, take a picture so that you know how to connect the wires to the new thermostat. Restores Heat to Your Dishwasher. Replacing the high limit thermostat can fix the following problems: Dishwasher doesn’t dry dishes properly; Dishwasher doesn’t clean dishes properly; Dishwasher doesn’t start; Door doesn’t latch shut. REPLACEMENT PART NUMBER: The 661566 Dishwasher High Limit Thermostat replaces part numbers: 3369777、3370783、3371618、4171694、WP661566、W10339474、WP661566VP、PS11743423 、AP6010246. Count on our 661566 Dishwasher High Limit Thermostat for an unrivaled mix of durability, convenient functionality, and great value for money. Save your time and money now! The Whirlpool brand names and logos are the registered trademarks of their respective owners. Any use of the Whirlpool brand name or model designation for this product is made solely for purposes of demonstrating compatibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41GVV0lYomL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WY","source_asin":"B08L974516","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-108018","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L974516","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L974516","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
