window.products.push({"id":108100,"name":"W10196405 W10196406 Chrome Drip Pans Kit by Blutoget -Compatible for Whirlpool Electric Range Burner-Replaces 0089285, 0091813, 0304979, 0310228 - Inc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.37,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ju0ND6ISL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"‎Durable Chrome Plated Steel ✅【CHROME BURNER DRIP PANS】: W10196405 Range Burner Drip Pans for electric stove and W10196406 electric stove burner drip pans is for ranges. Clean and durable W10196405 W10196406 whirlpool range drip pans collect spills from cooking utensils on surface burners. Whirlpool drip pans W10196405 W10196406 can fit the stove properly, prevent swinging drip pan elements, thus preventing cookware from rocking on the stove. Electric range burner pans are made from high quality material.Durable, stick free, easy to clean, dishwasher safe. ✅【GREAT VALUE PACK】: This chrome burner drip pans set includes 4 Pack of Chrome Oil Drip Pans: include 1 pc 8 Inch WP W10196405 whirlpool drip pans and 3 pcs 6 Inch WPW10196406 electric stove burner drip pans. 6\" drip pan measures 7 1/2\" and 8\" drip pan measures 9 3/8\" from end to end. Sliver color, using eco-friendly plating techniques. Please measure your drip pan before buying Size so that you can order an accurate replacement for your stove. Drip pans for whirlpool electric stove W10196405 W10196406 well-tested by the manufacturer. ✅【HIGH COMPATIBILITY】:W10196405 and W10196406 drip pans for electric stove compatible Whirlpool,Maytag,Ken-more Amana, Crosley, Estate, Inglis, Jenn Air etc. W10196405 replaces these parts: WPW10196405, AP6016814, AP11750107, PS11750107, 0042142, 0042169, 0064676, 0087838, 0088810, 0089285 etc. W10196406 replaces these parts: WPW10196406,1534547, AP6016815, PS11750108, EAP11750108, 101, 101A, 101AM, 256691, 296481etc.If you are not sure if the machine is right for you, please contact us and we will be happy to assist you. ✅【365 DAYS GUARANTEE 】:Risk-free shopping. Blutoget WPW10196405 WPW10196406 whirlpool stove drip pans for electric stove top is made of premium quality material, supports 365 DAYS return and exchange. We promise to ensure your absolute satisfaction with every purchase. If you have any quality problem about W10278125 burner drip pans during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ✅【EASY TO INSTALL】:Wait until the surface is cool to the touch before installing the drip pans for electric stove W10196405 W10196406. Remove the element from the stove top, and pull out the old whirlpool burner pans .Insert the new electric range drip pans and make sure it is aligned to where the element is plugged in.Put the element back in. For safety precautions, make sure to unplug the range from the power source and wait until the surface is cool before replacing this part.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ju0ND6ISL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blutoget","source_asin":"B08R9F2722","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-108100","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R9F2722","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R9F2722","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
