window.products.push({"id":108192,"name":"EATON WD125 Dryer Electrical Receptacle, V, 30 A, 3 Pole, 3 Wire , Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.42,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Dtpf+bZTL._AC_.jpg","description":"Cooper electrical receptacle, dryer, Cooper, 3 poles, 3 wires, 4 AWG wire, 30 a, 125 V, NEMA 10-30r, surface mounting, 4-3/4 in overall length, 2.4 in overall width, 2.1 in overall depth, black, 75 deg c, UL listed, for industrial, commercial and residential market sectors. The Eaton WD125 3-pole 3-wire 30-amp 125-Volt surface mount dryer power receptacle is ideal for any high amperage industrial or commercial power connectivity application. It is perfect to have installed in any garage, workshop, or Warehouse. This flush receptacle features a heavy gauge galvanized steel mounting strap and a glass-reinforced nylon body. It uses 30-amps with 125-volts and has 3-pole, 3-wire feature. The Eaton WD125 30-amp 125-Volt flush mount power receptacle has at its disposal a broad selection of wall plates available. This flush receptacle is the perfect amenity for anyone who uses high amperage appliances regularly and because of its durable material and sustainable features, it is a product that can be trusted. Eaton is committed to providing products that increase productivity, energy efficiency, safety at work and in the home, and produce reliable performance. Whether a home-feet's style is traditional, modern, casual, cozy or Rustic, it will demand more from wiring devices than in years past. Eaton is dedicated to providing the up-to-date wiring device solutions that today-feet's homes need.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Dtpf+bZTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eaton","source_asin":"B000FPDO4Y","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-108192","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000FPDO4Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B000FPDO4Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":108193,"name":"Oven Liners for Bottom of Oven Large 17\"x 25\" (2-Pack) Bundled with Stove Burner Covers 10.6” x 10.6” (4-Pack) - Large Oven Mat for Bottom of Oven Plu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hb6K3t-0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔ PREMIUM QUALITY OVEN LINERS & GAS STOVE LINERS: A set that comes with our best-selling non-stick large 17\"x 25\" Oven Liners for Bottom of Oven (2-Pack), and bundled with our 10.6” x 10.6” Gas Stove Covers (4-Pack). Ideal kitchen accessories to keep your oven and stove clean! ✔ IDEAL KITCHEN ACCESSORIES: Heavy duty oven liners to keep your oven free from any mess. The oven liner is safe for temperatures of up to 500°F (260°C). Bundled with heat resistant gas stove liners. NOTE: The material is not 100% fireproof. Do not use directly on flame or heat element. Do not use the stove liners to cover the stove gas holes. Remove protectors before cleaning stove. The stove burner cover is not suitable for electric stove. ✔ VERSATILE & CAN BE CUT TO CUSTOM FIT: Cleaning up your oven and stove range need not be a major feat ever again! Enjoy baking and cooking without any kind of spill and mess that would require a cleanup afterwards. The oven mat can be used as a protective grill mat, baking sheet, pan liner for electric and gas ovens, microwave ovens, kitchen stoves, toasters, grills, etc. The oven mat and the stove burner covers can be cut to smaller sizes. ✔ FOOD SAFE, BPA & PFOA FREE: Our products passed independent agency tests as per USA standards. They don’t add flavor nor smell to your food. Cheap products leach hazardous chemicals when heated in an oven. The oven liner and the stove burner cover are removable, and can be used over and over. Made to last and very easy to clean. Simply, wipe them off, wash with water or throw them in the dishwasher. ✔ AMERICAN BRAND QUALITY: ThreadNanny is a reputable family-owned American company. We take pride in the quality of our products. Please reach out to us in case of any issues and we’ll promptly do all we can to make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hb6K3t-0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ThreadNanny","source_asin":"B0BCMWMS4M","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-108193","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCMWMS4M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCMWMS4M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
