window.products.push({"id":108203,"name":"Stove Wrap Do It Yourself Stove Top Protector Splatter Guard Value Pack Kit - Fits all Electric Gas Compatible with Samsung GE LG and more, Free Oven ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nC3ZsS78L._AC_SL1408_.jpg","description":"STOVEWRAP’s Value Pack comes with our Stove Top & Oven Protective Splatter Guard DIY Kit to fully protect your stove top and oven, Plus our Multipurpose Large Protective Splatter Guard Roll. This cut to fit roll can be cut to protect your Toaster Oven, Microwave, Air Fryer, Indoor Grill, Kitchen Sink, Outdoor BBQ and more. With over 15 years’ experience and patents in countries around the world, we are the most experienced manufacturers of stove protective products for your HOME, RV and BOAT. We use the highest quality, extremely durable Teflon coated fiberglass material that lasts for years. Attempting to purchase pre-cut ultra-thin liners or the little squares to use on your stove, will only lead to frustration and wasted money. These types of liners are generic, only made for gas stoves (not electric coil or electric glass top) and since there are so many different brands, sizes and burner configurations, most of these liners or squares will not cover your stove top completely nor will they fit tightly around your burners. So, the best way to do it, is to do it yourself, with our easy customizable kit. You can ensure full coverage, a tight fit and maintenance free stove protecting/cleaning for years to come. No matter if you have a gas, electric glass top or induction stove, range or cooktop, we’ve got you covered. Get it right the first time and use the #1 selling brand of full cover stove top protectors/splatter guards, STOVEWRAP! STOVEWRAPS's Stove Top Protector & Splatter Guard provides a DIY kit that enables you to create a customized protective liner that perfectly fits your gas or electric stove, range or cooktop. STOVEWRAP will protect your stove and oven from those drips, spills and splatters that you inevitably get while cooking and will also protect your stove from scuffs and scratches caused by cleaning. No more scrubbing to get your stove top, oven or any other indoor/outdoor product clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nC3ZsS78L._AC_SL1408_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stove Wrap","source_asin":"B0854D5LZS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-108203","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0854D5LZS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0854D5LZS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
