window.products.push({"id":108294,"name":"VAUNO Additional Wireless Indoor Outdoor Temperature and Humidity Sensor for EN8822C-1 Hygrometer Humidity Gauge Meter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fE+VmJpnL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Additional Remote Sensor for VAUNO EN8822C-1 (ASIN: B08Z7NYHKK) Hygrometer Temperature and Humidity Gauge Meter Specifications : 1. Outdoor Temperature range:-40°F -- 158°F (-40°C--70°C) 2. Temperature resolution: 0.1°C/°F 3. Humidity range: 20%-95%; Humidity resolution: 1% 4. Wireless Range: 200ft/60m depending on home construction materials 5. Wireless Frequency: 433 MHz 6. Powered by 2xAAA batteries (included) PLEASE NOTE: This sensor can't be used alone, it need to synchronize to a receiver unit to display temp and humidity readings (search \"B08Z7NYHKK\" on amazon) Q&A Q: Will remote positioned in direct sunlight give unit a false reading? A: The sunlight will heat the remote. The temp will not be a false reading. It will be the temp of the remote in the sunlight . If you want ambient temp you must put it in a place where it has shade, good air circulation and no radiated heat from nearby structures such as, Buildings, parking lots, etc. Q: Is the outdoor sensor water proof? A: The outdoor sensor is not water proof. It must be vertically placed in a dry location, out of direct sunlight, and a foot or two away from heated / air conditioned structures. A sheltered location would likely be good. (roof overhang, underside of a waterproof deck, etc.) Q: What is the expected battery life? A: It will depend on the quality of batteries. Because the indoor unit keeps scan the remote’s signal every 10s and the remote sensor also needs to transmit signal frequently. We recommend you to use good quality batteries. You could monitor the battery status on the main unit. And please change the battery ASAP if one of the following 3 situations occurs. 1.Low battery indicator 2.the main monitor kept losing the remote’s signal 3.the touch screen buttons become insensitive","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fE+VmJpnL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VAUNO","source_asin":"B08ZCGYVHJ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-108294","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZCGYVHJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZCGYVHJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
