window.products.push({"id":108448,"name":"Kenmore 73045 25.6 cu.ft. French Door Refrigerator with Bottom-Freezer, includes delivery and hookup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mA7CDWiEL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Make food storage even easier with the Kenmore Finger Print Resistant Stainless Steel 25.6 cu. ft. French Door Bottom-Freezer Refrigerator. You'll be able to give your favorite foods the space and care they need. Outfitted with everything from gallon-sized door bins that give you space for juice, milk and tall bottles to a full-width gourmet pantry drawer that's perfect for pizzas, platters, trays and more, you'll love the space you have to organize your fresh and frozen favorite items. Your food will have more than enough breathing room inside the Kenmore 25.6 cu. ft. french door bottom-freezer refrigerator. A larger capacity means you'll be able to fit all your favorite snacks and meals inside this spacious fridge. If you're hosting a birthday party or potluck dinner, you'll certainly appreciate the full-width, gourmet pantry drawer that's perfect for storing party platters, pizzas, pies, fruit and veggies trays and more. Jugs of juice, gallons of milk, and more, this refrigerator's gallon-sized door bins give you space to fit just about any-sized drink container which means no more having to shove bottles in to make them fit. With the dual evaporator, you'll be able to make sure everything inside stays fresh longe becuse it produces separate cooling environments, creating ideal temperatures and humidity levels in both the refrigerator and freezer. Fill up your glass of water and chill it quickly and easily, thanks an exterior ice dispenser that makes both crushed and cubed ice. Take stock of the frozen foods you have (and what you need to pick up) simply by sliding out this refrigerator's bottom-mount freezer drawer. The freezer is equipped with Frost-Free technology, so your frozen food stays fresher longer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mA7CDWiEL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kenmore","source_asin":"B075QX1J7N","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-108448","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075QX1J7N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B075QX1J7N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
