window.products.push({"id":108602,"name":"Leyso Under Cabinet Stainless Steel Range Hood, Digital 3-Speed Control, 800 CFM, 2 LED Lights, Baffle Filters (36\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":277.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YjW9q+Z8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3-IN-1-DESIGN, DUCTED VENT OUTSIDE, 6” Top & 3-¼” x 10” TOP/REAR - Built with high quality 1mm thick 18-gauge stainless steel with satin finishing. 6” round top exhaust vent with air damper and adapter. This is a ducted model, required vent on wall or roof designed for better performance. Ducts are not included. Also includes a 10”W x 3-1/4”D rectangle adapter that is swappable between top and rear vent. 3 SPEEDS POWERFUL OPERATION, DIGITAL CONTROL & SPEED REMEMBERANCE - 3 speeds (I, II, III up to 800 CFM), touch sensor panel. Removes smells and odors with ease for a clean kitchen. Our range hood will remember your last speed setting when you turn it on again. Power rating: 120V/60Hz, 140W Max. Noise level at low: 49 dB, 4.5 sones. Noise level at high: 62 dB, 11.0 sones. 3 MINUTES AUTO SHUT OFF & CLOCK DISPLAY - Up to 3 minutes timer delayed auto shut off to vent the leftover smoke after cooking. Timer will shut off both the motor and the lights.To set the time, you press and hold the power button for 3 seconds to activate the clock setting mode. From there you can adjust your time from hours to minutes ranging from a 12 hours clock. 2 DISHWASHER SAFE BAFFLE FILTERS & 2 LED LIGHT- Dishwasher safe easily removable commercial style stainless steel baffle air filters. The oil is contained in the baffle filters. 2 of 3W energy saving cold bright LED lights. Light button operates independently from the power button. However when the 3 minutes auto shut off is finished, LED lights will turn off. 2 YEARS USA LIMITED PARTS WARRANTY - ETL Certified. Free parts, repair or exchange within 2 years. Leyso high quality product reputation and supreme customer service is a guarantee. Hood Body Dimensions: 35-1/2” W x 19-3/4” D x 6” H. 33 Lbs. 32” power cord with plug is included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YjW9q+Z8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Leyso","source_asin":"B084KZY4B5","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-108602","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084KZY4B5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B084KZY4B5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
