window.products.push({"id":108751,"name":"Techecook DC47-00016A Dryer Thermal Fuse Kit - DC47-00016A Thermal Fuse & DC96-00887A Thermostat & DC32-00007A Thermistor & DC47-00018A High Limit The","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617vo4WO-cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【ITEM SPECIALITY 】---☛DC47-00016A Dryer Thermal Cut-Off Thermostat shuts off the motor when dryer overheats,which is located on the blower housing.☛DC96-00887A Thermal Fuse with Bracket will shuts off the heat if the dryer overheats.☛DC32-00007A thermistor temperature sensor can monitor and help regulate the temperature inside the dryer.☛DC47-00018A Dryer High-Limit Thermostat maintains temperature between L260-50F, which will shuts off the heating element or burner when the dryer overheats. ✅【PACKAGE INCLUDES】--- Includes 1 x DC47-00016A Thermal Fuse, 1 x DC96-00887A Thermostat, 1 x DC32-00007A Thermistor, 1 x DC47-00018A High Limit Thermostat. If your dryer has the following problems: cannot dry properly, cannot start, no heat, not enough heat, temperature is too high, and drying ends too early, please replaces the DC47-00016A Dryer Thermal Fuse Kit, which can solve problems easily and get your dryer back to normal operation. ✅【WIDE COMPATIBLE】--- Techecook dryer thermal fuse kit fits for most top brands like Ken.more and Sam.sung dryer.►Replaces part numbers: ☛DC32-00007A:N3S1-K41, N3SI-K41, 2068429, AP4201716, PS2461163, EAP2461163.☛DC96-00887A:WP35001193, 35001193, 1185515, AP6008689, PS11741829, EAP11741829.☛DC47-00016A:2068545, AP4201894, EAP4205213, PS4205213.☛DC47-00018A:35001092, 1122485, AP4201898, PS2430930, EAP2430930, 503497, T-O-D 60T11. ✅【DIY INSTALLATION】--- DC47-00016A Dryer Thermal Fuse Kit is made with high quality materials. Before leaving the factory it has been fully tested by professionals and can be used with confidence.The installation of the sam.sung dryer fuse kit needs to use screwdriver and a multi-meter.If you're not sure how to install the sam.sung thermal fuse kit, you can find the repair video on YouTube and follow it, it is the easiest way. Please disconnect the power of the dryer before starting repair. ✅【WORRY-FREE SHOPPING】--- If the DC47-00016A Sam.sung Dryer Thermal Fuse Kit has any quality problem or other reasons, Please contact customer service in time, we will send you a new replacement or arrange a full refund, no need to return. Our company values the shopping experience of every customer, customer satisfaction is our unremitting pursuit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617vo4WO-cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Techecook","source_asin":"B08TLW6G73","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-108751","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TLW6G73","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TLW6G73","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
