window.products.push({"id":108834,"name":"HIFROM Replace 285785 Washer Clutch Kit and 285753A Motor Coupling Kit Replacement for Kenmore Sears Roper Estate Kitchenaid - Washing Machine Accesso","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tT7F2ORwL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"285785 Washer Clutch Assembly: 285785 washer clutch assembly is found in your washing machine and is responsible replacement for spinning the basket during the spin cycle.A worn-down clutch can lead to a slower spin which can lead to the machine not draining properly，leaving your clothes wet after a cycle.If you notice a burning smell，or the machine shaking and moving more than normal，this could indicate the need to replace your clutch.This clutch assembly comes with a brake cam driver，blue springs replacement for large capacity washers，and a dark spring replacement for compact washers. The blue spring (1.24 inches) replaces the dark spring (1.46 inches).This repair requires a half inch 1/16th socket with an extension and a ratchet，a pair of channel lock pliers，a Phillips screwdriver，medium size flat blade，a small flat blade，and a 1/4 inch nut driver.Replaces part numbers: 2670，285331，285380，285422，285540，285761，285785，285785VP，3350015，3350114，3350115，3351342，3351343，387888，388948，388949，3946794，3946847，3951311，3951312，62699，63174，63765，64176，AP3094537，AH334641，PS334641，EA334641，J27-662，LP326. 285753A Washer Motor Coupling Kit: The 285753A motor coupling replacement kit is replacement for direct drive washing machine.Motor Coupler kit 285753A replaces 285753，1195967，280152，285140，285743，3352470，3363664，3364002，3364003，62672，62693，661560，80008，8559748，AH1485646，EA1485646，PS1485646. Compatible with most popular brands: Kenmore，KitchenAid，Roper，Estate，Inglis，Crosley，Maytag，Admiral,Jenn-Air，Hardwick， Chef，Amana.Easy to install，it is a great repair kit replacement for wahser，save your money. Package Included: - 285785 Washer Clutch Kit- 285753A Washer Motor Coupler Kit with Metal Reinforced Core Note: This is Non original aftermarket Replacement Parts，please check the size replacement for compatibility before ordering it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tT7F2ORwL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIFROM","source_asin":"B07FY9FRZ5","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-108834","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FY9FRZ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FY9FRZ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
