window.products.push({"id":108996,"name":"Webcontrol Universal Network Enabled Timer Temperature Humidity I/o Controller","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nlFXASeNL._SL1486_.jpg","description":"Access through network, WebControl allows anyone to easily manage 8 output devices, monitor digital inputs, 8 temperature sensors, 3 analog inputs, a humidity sensor. It is manageable through a browser. It has web server inside this little board. It by default use DHCP to obtain IP address, also allow you to set static IP address. The eight TTL output is by default at logic zero. When an output is triggered or turned on, it sends out 5V, maximum drive current 20MA. It is capable to drive an optical isolated SSR (Solid State Relay, normal input control voltage 3-32V current is <10mA) device to run a motor, siren, light, heater or refrigerator. The most powerful feature of this device is its programmable output control. You dont need ladder diagram or programming it through any other software like other industrial PLC. This little board also has email function to send email alert through your ISP or email server of your own.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nlFXASeNL._SL1486_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"USA","source_asin":"B001H4JXLU","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-108996","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001H4JXLU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B001H4JXLU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
